'''Bramass Beastslayer''' is an [[NPC]] located on {{zone|Spiders Den}}, outside of {{Zone|Grandma's House}}, on the top of the hill. They introduce the player to the [[Bestiary]] and grant {{Item|Beastslayer's Codex}} after reaching [[Bestiary]] Milestone 50..

__TOC__

